{"id":"int-d115cfa8","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-08-17T15:22:43.65482974Z","actor":"michal.psencik","issue_id":"critstorm-5xo","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"holdout run and reported; the 90% floor is REFUTED, not validated. 3096 fresh seeds in 24 cohorts, provably disjoint from the tuning set by range: median -0.106538, stddev 0.270289, min -0.911, max 0.345, 24/24 cohorts below the floor. The tuning value 0.9036 sits +3.8 sigma above the holdout mean. Independently reproduced digit-for-digit by a blind verifier, which also showed a cohort sharing 128 of 129 seeds with the tuning set scores 0.835 — so 0.9036 is a property of that exact seed list. Constants left unchanged deliberately: a 4x3 grid over OVERCLOCK_FACTOR_PER_STACK and OVERCLOCK_SURGE_HEAT_SHARE lifted no holdout cohort above 0.09. Fixing this means re-specifying the metric, filed separately."}}
